'''Hip Hop Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] gains [[Immune to Warp]] and increases health, attack power and chance to [[Slow|slow]] [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Hip Hop Cat is unlocked in the Rare Cat Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

